notes.notes:
> Added 2 unlockable skins for all 6 Heroes (each Hero has now 3 different sprites);
> Fixed a position bug on the “Twin Blades” weapon card;
> Adjusted the moment that certain achievements must be in fact achieved;

> Added 5 unlockable Card Borders for Hero Cards (customization);
> Fixed a bug that made the “AP Source” Card to not be destroyed when changing floors;
> The “X” Card on Boss Battles will now be automatically destroyed 1.5 seconds after being revealed;
> “Rat” and “Imp” monster cards’ effect was updated;

> Adjusted the rate for the Weapons on Normal Floors and Boss Floors;
> The “AP Source” Event Card must now be clicked for its effect to be activated;
> The Cards’ rows are now identified from 1 to 3 for future features;
> The Cards’ columns are now identified from A to D for future features;
> Added two new unlockable Weapons;
> Save system on previous versions was broken and a new one was made. The game on this version (1.0.6) will be as it was installed for the first time. Sorry about that but beta is beta.

> Information about how many times you finished the game with each hero added to the hero’s information box on the Hero Select screen;
> Build version is now also displayed on the Floor Room;
> “Dagger” Weapon effect is now working properly and was increased from 20% to 25% chance;
> “Assassin’s Dagger” Weapon effect is now working properly and was increased from 40% to 50% chance;

List of Changes:
> Twitter page link added to the Title Screen;
> “USE” text replaced by “DUR” (durability);
> The Relic “Devil’s Scarab” is now a Shop-only Relic. Additionally, its bad effect was adjusted from -3 max Life Points to -2 max Life Points;
> Blade Oil item now visually identifies its target Card;
> fixed a bug that caused an error when finishing the game with the “Thief’s Belt” Relic;

Change list:
> better distribution of the unlockable cards;
> included on save file: build version and number of endings based on difficulty level;
> added visuals and information about the unlockable weapon cards on the hero select room;
> Wizard sprite and name updated to Cleric;
> increased chance for a chest to appear;
> now each hero creates a specific epic weapon when the special gauge fills up;
> hero’s epic weapon is now displayed on the hero selection room;
> Oil lamp and Floor Map effects will now activate only when the floor name bar is gone;
> Epic weapons will no longer lose 1 USE when you move to the next floor, however, your Special Gauge is frozen until the Epic Card is gone;
